senses.gloss:
आ-√ कल् (impf. आकलयत्) to tie, fasten, Śiś. ix, 45 ;
 (ind.p. -कलय्य) to surrender, transfer, BhP.;
to observe, notice, examine, take into consideration, reckon, consider, suppose, take for, BhP.; Śiś. iii, 73; Kathās. &c.

आ-√ काङ्क्ष् P. Ā. -काङ्क्षति, ˚ते, to desire, long for, endeavour to gain (with acc.), AitBr.; Mn. x, 121, &c., (rarely with gen.), Mn. ii, 162;
 (perf. -चकाङ्क्ष, R.; Ragh.)
to expect, wait for or till, Lāṭy.; MBh. xiv, 1279, &c.;
to endeavour to reach a place, turn to (acc.), Mn. iii, 258;
 (in Gr.) to require some word or words to be supplied for the completion of the sense, Pāṇ., Sch.
